        </div>
        <h2 class="font-abril text-4xl leading-tight text-[#113e14] md:text-5xl mb-8">
          Essential Care for
          Ornamental Plants
        </h2>
        <div class="text-[#416543] text-lg font-semibold leading-[2rem] mb-10">
          Ornamental plants are decorative plants valued for their colorful foliage, vibrant flowers, and natural
          beauty.
          <br><br>
          Perfect for gardens, indoor spaces, and landscapes, they enhance environments with freshness,
          elegance, and visual appeal while creating lively and attractive surroundings.
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-5">
          @!component('components/care/metric-card', {
            icon: 'resources/images/care/hand.png',
            title: 'Low Maintenance',
            text: 'Easy to care for daily',
