<section class="relative py-20 px-6 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="care-focus-panel homepage-lively-card overflow-hidden rounded-[42px] border shadow-xl backdrop-blur-2xl">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-5">
        <div class="lg:col-span-3 p-8 lg:p-12 flex flex-col justify-center">
          <div
            class="inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14] px-4 py-2 text-[#ebe3a7] text-[13px] tracking-[2px] font-semibold mb-6">
            <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#a8b841]"></div>ORNAMENTAL CARE
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-abril text-[#113e14] leading-tight mb-6">
            Proper Lighting
          </h2>
          <div class="text-[#113e14]/78 font-poppins text-[15px] leading-[1.9rem] max-w-xl">
            Healthy plant growth depends on providing proper growing conditions, including adequate light
            exposure. Ornamental plants grow best in bright areas with good light and air circulation, which
            help maintain healthy foliage and overall plant vigor.
            <br><br>
            The university also explains that healthy plants are better able to resist stress, insects, and
            diseases when grown under suitable environmental conditions. When natural light is limited,
            supplemental lighting such as fluorescent or LED grow lights can help support healthy plant
            development indoors.
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-8">
            <div
              class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-[#416543]/8 border border-[#416543]/12 rounded-2xl px-4 py-3 hover:bg-[#ebe3a7]/70 transition-all duration-300">
              <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-[#a8b841]/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/resources/images/care/11.png" alt="sun icon"
                  class="w-6 h-6 object-contain">
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="text-[#113e14] text-sm font-black">
                  Natural Light
                </div>
                <div class="text-[#416543] text-[12px] font-semibold">
                  Healthy daily growth
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div
              class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-[#416543]/8 border border-[#416543]/12 rounded-2xl px-4 py-3 hover:bg-[#ebe3a7]/70 transition-all duration-300">
              <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-[#a8b841]/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/resources/images/care/ll.png" alt="light icon" class="w-6 h-6 object-contain">
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="text-[#113e14] text-sm font-black">
                  Artificial Light
                </div>
                <div class="text-[#416543] text-[12px] font-semibold">
                  Perfect indoors
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:col-span-2 relative min-h-[380px]">
          <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/resources/images/care/44.png" alt="Plant lighting" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#113e14]/32"></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 bg-[#a8b841]/90 backdrop-blur-md border border-[#ebe3a7]/55 rounded-2xl px-5 py-4 shadow-xl">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-[#ebe3a7]/65 flex items-center justify-center">
                <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/resources/images/care/leaf.png" alt="leaf icon" class="w-6 h-6">
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-[#113e14] text-sm font-black">
                  13-16 Hours
                </p>
                <p class="text-[#416543] text-xs font-semibold">
                  Recommended light exposure
                </p>
