  </div>
</section>
<div class="w-full py-28 px-6 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center mb-20">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-[#ebe3a7]/82 px-6 py-3 text-[#113e14] text-sm tracking-[0.25em] uppercase shadow-lg">
      Ornamental Care Guide
      </div>
      <h2 class="mt-8 font-abril text-5xl leading-tight text-white md:text-6xl">
        Essential Care Tips
        <span class="text-[#ebe3a7]">
          for Ornamentals
        </span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-white/80 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Learn how to maintain healthy, vibrant, and beautiful ornamental plants with proper care and growing
        conditions.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="care-tip-grid grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-10">
      <div class="group relative">
        <div class="relative h-full bg-[#ebe3a7]/82 border border-[#ebe3a7]/48 rounded-[34px] overflow-hidden shadow-xl backdrop-blur-2xl transition hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300">
          <div class="relative p-8 pb-6">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[#113e14] text-[#ebe3a7] flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-poppins font-bold shadow-lg">
                01
              </div>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-3xl font-poppins font-bold text-[#113e14] leading-tight">
              Proper Watering
            </h3>
          </div>
          <div class="mx-8 h-[1px] bg-white/20"></div>
          <div class="p-8">
            <p class="text-[#416543] font-semibold leading-relaxed mb-6">
              Watering recommendations for ornamental plants:
              maintain consistent moisture levels
              avoid prolonged drought
              avoid overwatering
              check moisture levels below the soil surface.
            </p>
            <p class="text-[#113e14]/72 leading-relaxed text-sm">
              Roots absorb nutrients through water, so a lack of moisture directly affects the plant's
              growth.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="group relative">
        <div
          class="relative h-full bg-[#ebe3a7]/82 border border-[#ebe3a7]/48 rounded-[34px] overflow-hidden shadow-xl backdrop-blur-2xl transition hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300">

          <div class="relative p-8 pb-6">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[#113e14] text-[#ebe3a7] flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-poppins font-bold shadow-lg">
                02
              </div>
            </div>

            <h3 class="text-3xl font-poppins font-bold text-[#113e14] leading-tight">
              Soil and Nutrition
            </h3>
          </div>

          <div class="mx-8 h-[1px] bg-white/20"></div>
          <div class="p-8">
            <p class="text-[#416543] font-semibold leading-relaxed mb-6">
              Healthy soil supports healthy plants. Improving
              the soil with compost and organic matter helps develop stronger roots and improves moisture
              retention.
            </p>

            <p class="text-[#113e14]/72 leading-relaxed text-sm">
              Well-drained soil is important because excessive moisture can damage roots and weaken plant
              growth. Healthy soil also helps ornamental plants better resist stress and diseases.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>


      <div class="group relative">

        <div
          class="relative h-full bg-[#ebe3a7]/82 border border-[#ebe3a7]/48 rounded-[34px] overflow-hidden shadow-xl backdrop-blur-2xl transition hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300">

          <div class="relative p-8 pb-6">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[#113e14] text-[#ebe3a7] flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-poppins font-bold shadow-lg">
                03
              </div>
            </div>

            <h3 class="text-3xl font-poppins font-bold text-[#113e14] leading-tight">
              Fertilization
            </h3>
          </div>

          <div class="mx-8 h-[1px] bg-white/20"></div>
          <div class="p-8">
            <p class="text-[#416543] font-semibold leading-relaxed mb-6">
              Excess water can seriously damage ornamental plants. Soil that is too wet reduces the amount
              of oxygen available to the roots and can stunt plant growth.
            </p>

            <p class="text-[#113e14]/72 leading-relaxed text-sm">
              Excess moisture can lead to:

              root problems
              fungal diseases
              weakened foliage
              poor plant development
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>


      <div class="group relative">

        <div
          class="relative h-full bg-[#ebe3a7]/82 border border-[#ebe3a7]/48 rounded-[34px] overflow-hidden shadow-xl backdrop-blur-2xl transition hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300">

          <div class="relative p-8 pb-6">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">

              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[#113e14] text-[#ebe3a7] flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-poppins font-bold shadow-lg">
                04
              </div>

            </div>

            <h3 class="text-3xl font-black text-[#113e14] leading-tight">
              Growing in Pots
            </h3>
          </div>

          <div class="mx-8 h-[1px] bg-white/20"></div>
          <div class="p-8">
            <p class="text-[#416543] font-semibold leading-relaxed mb-6">
              It include information about growing plants in containers. Ornamental
              plants grown in pots may need more frequent watering because container soil dries faster
              than garden soil.
            </p>

            <p class="text-[#113e14]/72 leading-relaxed text-sm">
              Using containers with proper drainage helps prevent excess moisture and supports healthier
              root systems.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>


      <div class="group relative md:col-span-2 xl:col-span-2">

        <div
          class="relative h-full bg-[#ebe3a7]/82 border border-[#ebe3a7]/48 rounded-[34px] overflow-hidden shadow-xl backdrop-blur-2xl transition hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300">
          <div class="relative p-8 pb-6">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[#113e14] text-[#ebe3a7] flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-poppins font-bold shadow-lg">
                05
              </div>
            </div>

            <h3 class="text-3xl font-black text-[#113e14] leading-tight">
              Pests and Diseases
            </h3>
          </div>

          <div class="mx-8 h-[1px] bg-white/20"></div>

          <div class="p-8">
            <p class="text-[#416543] font-semibold leading-relaxed mb-6">
              It is recommended to prevent diseases by keeping plants healthy and maintaining proper
              growing conditions. They also advise:

              cleaning tools and containers
              checking plants regularly
              avoiding excessive moisture
              watching for insects and common plant problems
            </p>

            <p class="text-[#113e14]/72 leading-relaxed text-sm">

              Wet leaves and excessively damp conditions can increase the risk of disease in ornamental
              plants.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>






<hr class="mx-10 border-t-2 border-white/20 mb-24">

<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pb-24">

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-14 items-center">


    <div class="relative group">
      <div class="absolute -top-5 -left-5 w-full h-full border-2 border-[#113e14] rounded-[2.5rem]">
      </div>

      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-[0_25px_70px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)]">

        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/resources/images/care/99.jpg" alt=""
          class="w-full h-[650px] object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-700">

        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#113e14]/35">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>


    <div>

      <div class="text-[#113e14] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-sm font-bold mb-5">
        Ornamentals Plant Care
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black text-white leading-tight mb-8">
        General Tips for
        <span class="text-[#ebe3a7]">
          Caring for Ornamentals
        </span>
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-5 text-white/85 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          The most important steps for caring for your ornamentals are:
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
            <p>maintain healthy, well-drained soil</p>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
            <p>improve soil with compost and organic matter</p>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
            <p>provide consistent moisture without overwatering</p>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
            <p>water slowly near the roots</p>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
            <p>avoid wetting the leaves excessively</p>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
            <p>use mulch to conserve moisture</p>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
            <p>monitor insects and diseases regularly</p>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
            <p>keep tools and containers clean</p>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
            <p>provide proper light and air circulation</p>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
            <p>use containers with good drainage</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <button class="mt-10 px-8 py-4 bg-[#dca15d] hover:bg-[#ebe3a7] text-[#113e14] font-bold text-lg rounded-2xl
                 shadow-[0_15px_35px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
        get a plant
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
@end
